= Introduction

Traffic flow is well described by kinematic wave models \cite{daganzo2005}. Shrinkage
estimators were popularised by \textcite{tibshirani1996}; the proof of consistency is in
\cite[page=214, prefix="see", suffix="Lemma 2"]{tibshirani1996}.

Several textbooks agree \cite{ortuzar2011, daganzo2005}, and the typesetting tradition
goes back to \textcite[page=12]{knuth1984}.

